i class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7" href="#4_Applications_in_Food_Industry" >4. 食品工业中的应用</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8" href="#41_Potato_Flakes" >4.1 土豆片</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9" href="#42_Potato_Granules" >4.2 马铃薯颗粒</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-10" href="#5_Advantages_Performance_Attributes" >5. 优点 &amp; 性能属性</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-11" href="#51_Potato_Flakes" >5.1 土豆片</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-12" href="#52_Potato_Granules" >5.2 马铃薯颗粒</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-13" href="#6_Selection_Guidelines_for_Manufacturers" >6. 制造商选择指南</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-14" href="#7_Conclusion" >7. 结论</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-15" href="#Frequently_Asked_Questions" >常见问题解答</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-16" href="#What_is_the_difference_between_potato_flakes_and_granules" >马铃薯片和颗粒有什么区别?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-17" href="#Which_product_is_better_for_mashed_potato_dishes" >哪种产品更适合土豆泥菜肴?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-18" href="#Can_potato_flakes_be_used_directly_for_consumption" >土豆片可以直接吃吗?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-19" href="#How_are_potato_flakes_and_granules_processed_differently" >马铃薯片和颗粒的加工有何不同?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-20" href="#What_are_the_main_applications_of_potato_flakes" >马铃薯全片的主要用途有哪些?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-21" href="#What_are_the_main_applications_of_potato_granules" >马铃薯颗粒的主要用途有哪些?</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-22" href="#References" >参考</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2 data-start="221" data-end="239"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="1_Overview"></span><strong data-start="224" data-end="239">1. 概述</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="241" data-end="600">马铃薯片和马铃薯颗粒是马铃薯原料经过深加工生产的两种重要的脱水马铃薯原料. 尽管它们在原材料和基本加工步骤上有相似之处, 他们的不同之处在于 <strong data-start="465" data-end="531">物理形态, 功能特性, 和最佳应用</strong> 在工业食品生产中. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.potatoesflakes.com/potato-flakes-vs-granules-which-one-is-better-key-differences-explained/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">XION 马铃薯片制造商</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p><hr data-start="602" data-end="605" /><h2 data-start="607" data-end="652"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="2_Production_Processing_Differences"></span><strong data-start="610" data-end="652">2. 生产 &amp; 加工差异</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="654" data-end="859">尽管两种产品的起始原料和主要加工阶段相似 (洗涤, 脱皮, 烹饪, 糖化), 这 <strong data-start="789" data-end="858">关键差异发生在干燥和浆料形成步骤</strong>:</p><h3 data-start="861" data-end="882"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Potato_Flakes"></span><strong data-start="865" data-end="882">土豆片</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="884" data-end="1376"><li data-start="884" data-end="944"><p data-start="886" data-end="944">制作者： <strong data-start="898" data-end="913">滚筒干燥</strong> (也称为滚筒干燥).</p></li><li data-start="945" data-end="1079"><p data-start="947" data-end="1079">将煮熟的土豆泥浆铺在加热的滚筒上, 形成快速干燥的薄片，然后破碎成薄片.</p></li><li data-start="1080" data-end="1157"><p data-start="1082" data-end="1157">得到的产品是 <strong data-start="1107" data-end="1154">片状, 不规律的, 并且尺寸更大</strong>.</p></li><li data-start="1158" data-end="1283"><p data-start="1160" data-end="1283">滚筒干燥使淀粉部分糊化，但未完全煮熟, 留下一些结构以供进一步处理.</p></li><li data-start="1284" data-end="1376"><p data-start="1286" data-end="1376">非常适合用作其他配方的原材料. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.potatoesflakes.com/potato-flakes-vs-granules-which-one-is-better-key-differences-explained/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">XION 马铃薯片制造商</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p></li></ul><p><a href="/zh/products/">去查看我们的产品</a></p><h3 data-start="1378" data-end="1401"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Potato_Granules"></span><strong data-start="1382" data-end="1401">马铃薯颗粒</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="1403" data-end="1867"><li data-start="1403" data-end="1512"><p data-start="1405" data-end="1512">生产使用 <strong data-start="1420" data-end="1461">喷雾或附聚干燥方法</strong> 创造统一的 <strong data-start="1482" data-end="1509">细粒状颗粒</strong>.</p></li><li data-start="1513" data-end="1582"><p data-start="1515" data-end="1582">这导致 <strong data-start="1533" data-end="1579">更充分的煮熟和颗粒结构</strong>.</p></li><li data-start="1583" data-end="1688"><p data-start="1585" data-end="1688">颗粒往往是 <strong data-start="1605" data-end="1646">较小, 更统一, 更高的密度</strong>, 并重新水化成更光滑的质地.</p></li><li data-start="1689" data-end="1867"><p data-start="1691" data-end="1867">由于颗粒形成过程中的蒸煮更完全, 颗粒可以达到 <strong data-start="1773" data-end="1809">补水后质地更细腻</strong> 与片状相比. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.potatoesflakes.com/potato-flakes-vs-granules-which-one-is-better-key-differences-explained/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">XION 马铃薯片制造商</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p></li></ul><blockquote data-start="1869" data-end="2008"><p data-start="1871" data-end="2008"><strong data-start="1871" data-end="1907">您的行业经验一致:</strong> 由于滚筒干燥，薄片呈片状, 而颗粒更细，颗粒结构清晰.</p></blockquote><hr data-start="2010" data-end="2013" /><h2 data-start="2015" data-end="2060"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="3_Functional_Properties_Differences"></span><strong data-start="2018" data-end="2060">3. 功能特性 &amp; 差异</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex w-fit flex-col-reverse" tabindex="-1"><table class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)" data-start="2062" data-end="2858"><thead data-start="2062" data-end="2107"><tr data-start="2062" data-end="2107"><th data-start="2062" data-end="2072" data-col-size="md">特征</th><th data-start="2072" data-end="2088" data-col-size="md">土豆片</th><th data-start="2088" data-end="2107" data-col-size="sm">马铃薯颗粒</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="2155" data-end="2858"><tr data-start="2155" data-end="2196"><td data-start="2155" data-end="2162" data-col-size="md">形式</td><td data-start="2162" data-end="2180" data-col-size="md">不规则片状</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2180" data-end="2196">细颗粒</td></tr><tr data-start="2197" data-end="2326"><td data-start="2197" data-end="2234" data-col-size="md">产品配方中的典型用途</td><td data-start="2234" data-end="2286" data-col-size="md">零食的多功能成分, 混合产品</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2286" data-end="2326">主要用于土豆泥产品</td></tr><tr data-start="2327" data-end="2387"><td data-start="2327" data-end="2343" data-col-size="md">干燥方法</td><td data-col-size="md" data-start="2343" data-end="2357">滚筒干燥</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2357" data-end="2387">喷雾/附聚干燥</td></tr><tr data-start="2388" data-end="2440"><td data-start="2388" data-end="2413" data-col-size="md">烹饪/糊化</td><td data-col-size="md" data-start="2413" data-end="2423">部分的</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2423" data-end="2440">更完整</td></tr><tr data-start="2441" data-end="2506"><td data-start="2441" data-end="2463" data-col-size="md">补水质地</td><td data-col-size="md" data-start="2463" data-end="2484">较粗, 某个身体</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2484" data-end="2506">奶油味儿, 更顺畅</td></tr><tr data-start="2507" data-end="2572"><td data-start="2507" data-end="2526" data-col-size="md">吸水率</td><td data-start="2526" data-end="2537" data-col-size="md">缓和</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2537" data-end="2572">降低并有效吸收</td></tr><tr data-start="2573" data-end="2628"><td data-start="2573" data-end="2598" data-col-size="md">粘度 (再水化的)</td><td data-col-size="md" data-start="2598" data-end="2607">更高</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2607" data-end="2628">较低至中等</td></tr><tr data-start="2629" data-end="2742"><td data-start="2629" data-end="2660" data-col-size="md">在二次加工中的作用</td><td data-start="2660" data-end="2701" data-col-size="md">作为粘合剂效果很好, 纹理修改器</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2701" data-end="2742">非常适合直接捣碎产品</td></tr><tr data-start="2743" data-end="2858"><td data-start="2743" data-end="2858" data-col-size="md"><em data-start="2743" data-end="2858">(基于加工和结构的一般行业功能差异) <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://potatogoodness.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Module-4-final.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">马铃薯的好处</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></em></td><td data-col-size="md"></td><td data-col-size="sm"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><h3 data-start="2860" data-end="2896"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="31_Cooking_Gelatinization"></span><strong data-start="2864" data-end="2896">3.1 烹饪 &amp; 糊化</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="2898" data-end="3381">一个重要的细微差别——<strong data-start="2918" data-end="2971">马铃薯片一般没有完全糊化</strong> 干燥期间, 因为它们预计将用于进一步加工，其中加热/淀粉糊化将在稍后完成. 这使得薄片适合作为 <strong data-start="3132" data-end="3158">配方成分</strong> 而不是成品食品. 反过来, <strong data-start="3208" data-end="3293">马铃薯颗粒通常在干燥/结块阶段完全糊化</strong>, 给他们一个 <strong data-start="3309" data-end="3356">直接补水时口感更顺滑</strong>. (您的专家见解)</p><p data-start="3383" data-end="3438">这种差异影响 <strong data-start="3407" data-end="3435">补水后的质地</strong>:</p><ul data-start="3439" data-end="3662"><li data-start="3439" data-end="3557"><p data-start="3441" data-end="3557"><em data-start="3441" data-end="3450">薄片:</em> 当掺入复合配方时，往往会生产出具有更多结构或口感的产品.</p></li><li data-start="3558" data-end="3662"><p data-start="3560" data-end="3662"><em data-start="3560" data-end="3571">颗粒剂:</em> 生产更顺畅, 单独加水时，糖化效果更细腻. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://potatogoodness.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Module-4-final.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">马铃薯的好处</span></span></span></a></span></span></p></li></ul><hr data-start="3664" data-end="3667" /><h2 data-start="3669" data-end="3708"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="4_Applications_in_Food_Industry"></span><strong data-start="3672" data-end="3708">4. 食品工业中的应用</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="3710" data-end="3878">马铃薯片和颗粒均可用于各种加工食品类别, 但他们的 <strong data-start="3798" data-end="3831">首选应用不同</strong> 基于质地和配方要求.</p><h3 data-start="3880" data-end="3905"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="41_Potato_Flakes"></span><strong data-start="3884" data-end="3905">4.1 土豆片</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="3907" data-end="3940">马铃薯片广泛应用于:</p><ul data-start="3942" data-end="4308"><li data-start="3942" data-end="3999"><p data-start="3944" data-end="3999">零食和方便食品 (筹码, 膨化零食)</p></li><li data-start="4000" data-end="4045"><p data-start="4002" data-end="4045">烘焙产品 (卷, 面包, 饼干)</p></li><li data-start="4046" data-end="4089"><p data-start="4048" data-end="4089">复合食品 (混合, 混合)</p></li><li data-start="4090" data-end="4144"><p data-start="4092" data-end="4144">水结合成分, 纹理修改</p></li><li data-start="4145" data-end="4195"><p data-start="4147" data-end="4195">风味增强和营养强化</p></li><li data-start="4196" data-end="4308"><p data-start="4198" data-end="4308">需要坚固耐用的工业混合配方, 溶解性较小的颗粒 <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.potatoesflakes.com/why-use-potato-flakes-what-are-the-applications/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">XION 马铃薯片制造商</span></span></span></a></span></span></p></li></ul><h3 data-start="4310" data-end="4337"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="42_Potato_Granules"></span><strong data-start="4314" data-end="4337">4.2 马铃薯颗粒</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="4339" data-end="4376">通常选择马铃薯颗粒:</p><ul data-start="4378" data-end="4673"><li data-start="4378" data-end="4430"><p data-start="4380" data-end="4430"><strong data-start="4380" data-end="4414">即食土豆泥产品</strong> (主要用途)</p></li><li data-start="4431" data-end="4494"><p data-start="4433" data-end="4494">准备好的饭菜, 机构餐饮服务 (学校, 医院)</p></li><li data-start="4495" data-end="4520"><p data-start="4497" data-end="4520">汤底, 干混料</p></li><li data-start="4521" data-end="4576"><p data-start="4523" data-end="4576">酱汁中的增稠剂和质地改良剂, 肉汁</p></li><li data-start="4577" data-end="4673"><p data-start="4579" data-end="4673">具有光滑质地要求的零食和烘焙混合物 <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://sahugroup.co.in/potato-granules/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">sahugroup.co.in</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p></li></ul><hr data-start="4675" data-end="4678" /><h2 data-start="4680" data-end="4725"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="5_Advantages_Performance_Attributes"></span><strong data-start="4683" data-end="4725">5. 优点 &amp; 性能属性</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><h3 data-start="4727" data-end="4752"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="51_Potato_Flakes"></span><strong data-start="4731" data-end="4752">5.1 土豆片</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="4753" data-end="5074"><li data-start="4753" data-end="4827"><p data-start="4755" data-end="4827"><strong data-start="4755" data-end="4771">多功能性:</strong> 非常适合土豆泥以外的各种应用.</p></li><li data-start="4828" data-end="4942"><p data-start="4830" data-end="4942"><strong data-start="4830" data-end="4859">成分功能:</strong> 可以改善水结合力, 质地, 并可包含在复合食品混合物中.</p></li><li data-start="4943" data-end="5074"><p data-start="4945" data-end="5074"><strong data-start="4945" data-end="4965">成本效益:</strong> 由于干燥过程经济性，与颗粒相比成本通常更低. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.potatoesflakes.com/potato-flakes-vs-granules-which-one-is-better-key-differences-explained/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">XION 马铃薯片制造商</span></span></span></a></span></span></p></li></ul><h3 data-start="5076" data-end="5103"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="52_Potato_Granules"></span><strong data-start="5080" data-end="5103">5.2 马铃薯颗粒</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="5104" data-end="5386"><li data-start="5104" data-end="5187"><p data-start="5106" data-end="5187"><strong data-start="5106" data-end="5125">奶油质地:</strong> 颗粒再水化成更光滑、更均匀的糊状.</p></li><li data-start="5188" data-end="5257"><p data-start="5190" data-end="5257"><strong data-start="5190" data-end="5209">更高密度:</strong> 更好的仓储和运输效率.</p></li><li data-start="5258" data-end="5386"><p data-start="5260" data-end="5386"><strong data-start="5260" data-end="5288">成品使用能力:</strong> 适合直接补水作为糖化成品. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.idahopacific.com/potato-granules?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">爱达荷太平洋公司</span></span></span></a></span></span></p></li></ul><hr data-start="5388" data-end="5391" /><h2 data-start="5393" data-end="5441"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="6_Selection_Guidelines_for_Manufacturers"></span><strong data-start="5396" data-end="5441">6. 制造商选择指南</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="5443" data-end="5515">在食品生产中选择薄片和颗粒时, 考虑:</p><div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex w-fit flex-col-reverse" tabindex="-1"><table class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)" data-start="5517" data-end="5904"><thead data-start="5517" data-end="5547"><tr data-start="5517" data-end="5547"><th data-start="5517" data-end="5526" data-col-size="sm">因素</th><th data-start="5526" data-end="5535" data-col-size="sm">薄片</th><th data-start="5535" data-end="5547" data-col-size="sm">颗粒剂</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="5579" data-end="5904"><tr data-start="5579" data-end="5640"><td data-start="5579" data-end="5603" data-col-size="sm">最终产品质地</td><td data-start="5603" data-end="5622" data-col-size="sm">结构化, 身体</td><td data-start="5622" data-end="5640" data-col-size="sm">光滑的, 奶油味的</td></tr><tr data-start="5641" data-end="5719"><td data-start="5641" data-end="5651" data-col-size="sm">最终用途</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="5651" data-end="5682">零食中的成分 / 混合</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="5682" data-end="5719">直接捣碎 / 顺利申请</td></tr><tr data-start="5720" data-end="5799"><td data-start="5720" data-end="5745" data-col-size="sm">加工要求</td><td data-start="5745" data-end="5774" data-col-size="sm">预计二次烹饪</td><td data-start="5774" data-end="5799" data-col-size="sm">补水后准备好</td></tr><tr data-start="5800" data-end="5845"><td data-start="5800" data-end="5826" data-col-size="sm">配方灵活性</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="5826" data-end="5833">高的</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="5833" data-end="5845">缓和</td></tr><tr data-start="5846" data-end="5904"><td data-start="5846" data-end="5867" data-col-size="sm">成本考虑</td><td data-start="5867" data-end="5885" data-col-size="sm">一般较低</td><td data-start="5885" data-end="5904" data-col-size="sm">可能会更高</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p><a href="/zh/about-us/">关于我公司资质</a></p><hr data-start="5906" data-end="5909" /><h2 data-start="5911" data-end="5931"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="7_Conclusion"></span><strong data-start="5914" data-end="5931">7. 结论</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="5933" data-end="6483">马铃薯片和马铃薯颗粒源自相同的原材料和相似的早期加工过程, 他们的分歧在于 <strong data-start="6062" data-end="6136">干燥法, 颗粒形式, 烹饪程度, 和应用重点</strong>. 马铃薯片是一种多功能工业原料，非常适合零食和混合产品, 而颗粒提供了 <strong data-start="6259" data-end="6306">更细腻的质地和直接捣碎的能力</strong> 适用于土豆泥产品. 了解这些差异使制造商能够优化两者的配方 <strong data-start="6432" data-end="6482">功能性能和最终产品质量</strong>.</p><hr data-start="6485" data-end="6488" /><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Frequently_Asked_Questions"></span><strong>常见问题解答</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_is_the_difference_between_potato_flakes_and_granules"></span>马铃薯片和颗粒有什么区别?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p>马铃薯片呈片状且部分糊化, 理想的零食和复合产品成分. 颗粒完全糊化, 较小, 更顺畅, 适用于即食土豆泥产品.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Which_product_is_better_for_mashed_potato_dishes"></span>哪种产品更适合土豆泥菜肴?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p>马铃薯颗粒是马铃薯泥菜肴的首选，因为它们已完全煮熟，并且在再水化时会产生更奶油般的质地.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Can_potato_flakes_be_used_directly_for_consumption"></span>土豆片可以直接吃吗?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p>马铃薯片通常未完全煮熟，旨在用作进一步加工的原料, 而不是直接消费.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_are_potato_flakes_and_granules_processed_differently"></span>马铃薯片和颗粒的加工有何不同?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p>两种产品具有相似的加工步骤, 但将薄片滚筒干燥以生产片状薄片, 而颗粒被干燥/附聚以产生小颗粒, 均匀颗粒.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_are_the_main_applications_of_potato_flakes"></span>马铃薯全片的主要用途有哪些?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p>马铃薯片用于零食, 烘焙产品, 复合混合物, 以及作为水结合和质地改性的功能成分.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_are_the_main_applications_of_potato_granules"></span>马铃薯颗粒的主要用途有哪些?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p>马铃薯颗粒用于即食土豆泥, 汤, 准备好的饭菜, 以及其他需要光滑的产品, 奶油质地.</p></div><hr /><h2 data-start="6490" data-end="6520"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="References"></span><strong data-start="6493" data-end="6520">参考 </strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><ul><li data-start="6490" data-end="6520">马铃薯片与颗粒: 差异解释. (日期不详。). <em data-start="6582" data-end="6615">马铃薯片制造商 XION</em>. 检索自 <a class="decorated-link" href="https://www.potatoesflakes.com/potato-flakes-vs-granules-which-one-is-better-key-differences-explained/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_new" rel="noopener nofollow" data-start="6632" data-end="6735">https://www.potatoesflakes.com/potato-flakes-vs-capsules-which-one-is-better-key-differences-explained/</a> <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.p